# Docker build context for the root Dockerfile: only Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock,
# crates/ and scripts/container/ are used. Everything else stays out so a change
# to docs or CI does not invalidate the build cache and no local state is sent.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!scripts/container/
# Build output inside the allowed directories.
**/target/
# Local state that must never reach an image layer.
**/.tole/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/
